  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "VoxCommunis",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tVoxCommunis Corpus\n\t\n\nThe VoxCommunis Corpus is a phonetic corpus derived from the Mozilla Common Voice Corpus. Corresponding audio files and corpus metadata can be downloaded from Mozilla Common Voice, or from one of several Hugging Face repositories for the differing versions. \nWithin each folder, the filenames share similar structure and contain critical information for effectively using the file. More detail regarding the specifics of the filename for each file type is provided\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/pacscilab/VoxCommunis.",
